{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra/nginx cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf:1-12` — Preserve committed seed, generated live include, host-nginx glob consumer, safe default upstream. Consumer: nginx/materializer.\n- `infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template:1-37,44-53,89-201,249-300` — Preserve TLS/HSTS, switchable MCP upstream, literal forwarded scheme, prefix/redirect rewriting, op-cert guard, SSE buffering/timeouts, RFC 9728 metadata, Gerrit proxy behavior. Consumer: nginx/operators/security review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Every consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] No executable behavior changes; verified by inspecting the final diff and running the command under Verification.\n- [ ] No test assertion changes; verified by inspecting the final diff.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788585332116807001,"uuid":"7e0f3a26-c964-47fe-9af3-4494eceefe6c"}